    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>Vintage Botanical Duvet Cover Set | KASODI</title>

    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Discover the Vintage Botanical Duvet Cover Set selected by KASODI for its rich floral pattern, muted blue-green palette and warm vintage-inspired character."
    />
  </head>

  <body>

    <Header />

    <main class="product-detail-page">

      <div class="product-breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <a href="/new-finds">New Finds</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>Vintage Botanical Duvet Cover Set</span>
      </div>


      <section class="product-detail-hero">

        <div class="product-detail-image">
          <img
            src="/images/new-finds/vintage-botanical-duvet-cover-set.png"
            alt="Vintage botanical duvet cover set styled by KASODI"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="product-detail-content">

          <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
            NEW FINDS · TEXTILES & COZY
          </p>

          <h1>
            Vintage Botanical Duvet Cover Set
          </h1>

          <p class="product-detail-brand">
            Fashionbedding
          </p>

          <p class="product-detail-intro">
            A richly patterned bedding set combining muted blue-green tones with
            warm rust, ochre and cream botanical detailing. The dense floral design
            gives the bed a layered, collected character while the darker palette
            creates a warm and cocooning atmosphere.
          </p>


          <div class="product-detail-divider"></div>


          <div class="product-detail-meta">

            <div>
              <span>Material</span>
              <strong>100% Polyester</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Set</span>
              <strong>3 pieces</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Includes</span>
              <strong>Duvet cover · 2 pillowcases</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Colour</span>
              <strong>Blue-green · Rust · Cream</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Pattern</span>
              <strong>Botanical · Floral</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Care</span>
              <strong>Machine washable</strong>
            </div>

          </div>


          <div class="affiliate-action">

            <a
              href="https://temu.to/k/eq1c51qfdqt"
              target="_blank"
              rel="nofollow sponsored noopener"
              class="product-shop-button"
            >
              Find It Here →
            </a>

            <p class="affiliate-note">
              Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="why-we-love">

        <div class="why-we-love-label">
          KASODI NOTE
        </div>

        <div class="why-we-love-content">

          <h2>Why we love it</h2>

          <p>
            This is the kind of bedding that can completely change the character
            of a bedroom without requiring a full redesign. The intricate botanical
            pattern feels decorative and expressive, while the muted blue-green
            background keeps the overall look sophisticated rather than overly busy.
          </p>

          <p>
            We particularly like the combination of cool blue-green with rust,
            ochre, cream and soft pink details. These warmer tones make the print
            easy to combine with natural wood, aged brass, ivory linen and simple
            neutral cushions. It works especially well in rooms where the bedding
            is intended to become the main decorative feature.
          </p>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-care">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          CARE
        </p>

        <h2>Made for an easy bedroom refresh</h2>

        <p>
          The set is listed as machine washable and suitable for year-round use.
          Wash with similar colours on a gentle cycle and avoid harsh bleaching
          products to help preserve the depth of the botanical print over time.
          Follow the manufacturer's care instructions for drying and ironing.
        </p>

      </section>


      <section class="styling-ideas">

        <div class="styling-heading">
          <p>KASODI STYLING</p>
          <h2>Style it with</h2>
        </div>


        <div class="styling-grid">

          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Warm Neutrals</h3>
            <p>
              Add ivory, oatmeal or warm taupe sheets and cushions to soften the
              detailed botanical print and keep the bedroom balanced.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Dark Wood</h3>
            <p>
              Walnut, dark oak or other warm wooden furniture brings out the deeper
              rust and brown tones woven through the pattern.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Aged Brass</h3>
            <p>
              Vintage-inspired brass lamps, frames or small decorative objects add
              warmth and give the room a more collected, layered character.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="continue-exploring">

        <div class="continue-exploring-heading">
          <p>NEW FINDS</p>
          <h2>Continue Exploring</h2>
        </div>


        <div class="continue-exploring-grid">


          <a
            href="/new-finds/vintage-botanical-jewelry-box"
            class="continue-card"
          >
            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/new-finds/vintage-botanical-jewelry-box.png"
                alt="Vintage Botanical Jewelry Box"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>DECORATIVE OBJECTS</span>
              <h3>Vintage Botanical Jewelry Box</h3>
              <p>Tila Home</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>
          </a>


          <a
            href="/new-finds/vintage-butterfly-photo-frame"
            class="continue-card"
          >
            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/new-finds/vintage-butterfly-photo-frame.png"
                alt="Vintage Butterfly Photo Frame"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>DECORATIVE OBJECTS</span>
              <h3>Vintage Butterfly Photo Frame</h3>
              <p>LEYI DECOR</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>
          </a>


          <a
            href="/new-finds/fanquare-blue-floral-dessert-plates"
            class="continue-card"
          >
            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/new-finds/fanquare-blue-floral-dessert-plates.png"
                alt="Blue Floral Dessert Plates"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>TABLEWARE</span>
              <h3>Blue Floral Dessert Plates</h3>
              <p>fanquare</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>
          </a>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-final-cta">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          FASHIONBEDDING · BOTANICAL TEXTILES
        </p>

        <h2>
          A richly layered pattern for a bedroom with character.
        </h2>

        <a
          href="https://temu.to/k/eq1c51qfdqt"
          target="_blank"
          rel="nofollow sponsored noopener"
          class="product-shop-button"
        >
          Find It Here →
        </a>

        <p class="affiliate-note affiliate-note-light">
          Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
        </p>

      </section>

    </main>


    <Footer />

  </body>
</html>